			"notes": "Bug Fix:\n - ic2 fluid unit can fill rockets without consumption\n - GT6 fluid barrel can fill Gas Charger without consumption\n\n Content Change:\n - Buckets,Barrels,Fluid Units or something cannot fill Rockets anymore\n - All text exist in en_US.lang are fully translated zh_CN.lang\n\nzh_CN:\nBug修复\n - 装有火箭燃料的ic2流体单元可以无消耗地填充火箭\n - GT6的储罐可以无消耗地填充气体装填台\n\n内容变更\n - 桶、储罐或者什么的不再能填装火箭\n - 将en_US.lang里存在的全部文字译为中文\n\nAlthough I made this for TerraFirmaRescue UnOfficial, there are not any break changes\nMeans You can use it in your modpack only for these bugfix or translate, make sure you didn't obey original AR license.\n尽管此仓库为苦钻怕为群峦救援非官方版所设，目前本mod中并没有太多重大修改，意味着你也可以在遵守原版AR协议的情况下，仅为了这些翻译和bug修复而自由的使用在您的整合包中"
